| Register | Direction | EGW | EGS | EEW | Definition |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Vd | input | 128 | 4 | 32 | Current state X[0:3] |
| Vs2 | input | 128 | 4 | 32 | Round keys rk[0:3] |
